# Cloudflare Pages headers. GitHub Pages (production at chancey.io) ignores
# this file, so production is unaffected. Cloudflare Pages only serves the
# staging environment (staging.chancey.io + *.chancey-staging.pages.dev),
# so this keeps the entire staging environment — every HTML page, llms.txt,
# robots.txt, sitemap, and asset — out of search engines and AI crawlers
# that honor X-Robots-Tag, regardless of what robots.txt allows.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noai, noimageai
